# court-progress: the citadel's court after a trial room. endgame-baphomet DKSAVE6 (483.07, "3rd done", DS:160C = 0x0707 in its .BSV) set at
# card 365 ($LastC11, back to the courtyard, previous card 350), saved outside the battle (local/oracle-saves/court/DKSAVE6-card365.SAV).
# The card adds the room's door bit and starts the courtyard fight (battlefield 0x57): the original builds the court from DS:160C (the
# party at the returning door's spot, no enemies); the combatant records of every pass are compared (--battle-records).
# No state step: the synthetic save keeps its .BSV of a game saved in the battle, whose in-battle mark the original writes back into the
# header at load (a pair a game never writes); the battle and its combatant records are what this session checks.
key:t
wait:5
key:l
wait:300
bwait:5
bwait:40
bwait:40
